200&blur=200&s=43ca6ab5467f7ae2a3f72f5b330d87c8, https://si.imgix.net/d5e0567e/uploads/origins/8f4a0c15-c78c-4724-915a-7207aed480d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=44389b7761b5ee7fa5315992aa53b65c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d5e0567e/uploads/origins/8f4a0c15-c78c-4724-915a-7207aed480d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=487d49e8e4bf3853c55089f8a66f45b0 3x"}, "body": "Hello!\nYour art is so beautiful! \n\nI would love to request you with a drawing of my OC called [Cappuccino | カプチーノ ] and the character [Risotto Nero | リゾット] from JJBA. They are in a romantic relationship and assassins. \n\n[カプチーノ]:\n\n29 years old. 166cm tall with shoes. She is an adult, mature woman with a curvy and muscular build. Quiet and calm personality wise, has weird mannerisms and can be very eccentric. Generally she appears as quite creepy and ominous by people who don’t know her. She is usually more outgoing and lighthearted in private and especially when she is together with her lover [リゾット]\n\n[リゾット]:\n\n28 years old. 195cm tall with a very muscular build. Very serious and stoic personality wise. A very intimidating, analytical and smart person who always gets his assassinations done perfectly. With [カプチーノ] he is more relaxed , attentive and very protective, attentive and gentle with her.\n\n\nFor this commission I would love a cute and cool romantic interaction between them! It can be a sweet and lighthearted interaction or anything else you see fitting. I leave creative freedom to you!\n\nIt would be amazing if you keep their huge height difference in mind. I would be happy if you could include a simple background and transparent versions! If you could add for the background some red and blue rose petals and razor blades or knives. If that should be okay for you. \n\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-A7BYIsRbqNhiC5wwOY5Vr7aJ__JFEfQ", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Kota_014pr/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3553015, "client_id": 1698798, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/df4f966d/uploads/origins/df99cc79-c58e-41c7-b239-4c0f39828a78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=910a985f84d4b0b690ce57d896ff39e0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/df4f966d/uploads/origins/df99cc79-c58e-41c7-b239-4c0f39828a78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=910a985f84d4b0b690ce57d896ff39e0, https://si.imgix.net/df4f966d/uploads/origins/df99cc79-c58e-41c7-b239-4c0f39828a78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7a525371922ef327f2791ec86a460d9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/df4f966d/uploads/origins/df99cc79-c58e-41c7-b239-4c0f39828a78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0c7d1756b7d27e5770e5b63bca457c9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/df4f966d/uploads/origins/df99cc79-c58e-41c7-b239-4c0f39828a78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff4447e205a71440ee375f9233e36449", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/df4f966d/uploads/origins/df99cc79-c58e-41c7-b239-4c0f39828a78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff4447e205a71440ee375f9233e36449, https://si.imgix.net/df4f966d/uploads/origins/df99cc79-c58e-41c7-b239-4c0f39828a78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=19649d61a2a61df37fd1150912135721 2x, https://si.imgix.net/df4f966d/uploads/origins/df99cc79-c58e-41c7-b239-4c0f39828a78?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=66129fa2684b6a8b629f80f0974b3299 3x"}, "body": "あなたの絵は美しいですね。ぜひリクエストさせてください！\n私のバーチャルストリーマーのクレアを描いてください！https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ukkOFeWXqkGI1OkRwTywNovgAglacwpe?usp=sharing。クレアはお天気の魔女（雲、雨、雷、雪などを操る）で、髪は雲でできているので、とても軽くてふわふわしています。彼女は優しくて自信家。ポーズと背景はあなた次第です。\nあなたのアートを私のストリーミング・ソーシャルメディア（Twitch、Twitter、Patreonなど）に使用したいです。このアート作品の商用権をお願いしたいです。ありがとうございました。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Kota_014pr/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3553015, "client_id": 187973, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4ab8ed24/uploads/origins/92e80d0c-02fa-4ab5-bc8a-4ad9eb4859bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ad3ba7530088048e9e2e0b3ef7902e2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4ab8ed24/uploads/origins/92e80d0c-02fa-4ab5-bc8a-4ad9eb4859bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ad3ba7530088048e9e2e0b3ef7902e2, https://si.imgix.net/4ab8ed24/uploads/origins/92e80d0c-02fa-4ab5-bc8a-4ad9eb4859bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f5bba9210cfa01886d9491a835e0e6c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4ab8ed24/uploads/origins/92e80d0c-02fa-4ab5-bc8a-4ad9eb4859bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=339129fcc306bf307c10e4f6d09d22d7 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4ab8ed24/uploads/origins/92e80d0c-02fa-4ab5-bc8a-4ad9eb4859bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6e42bebfc76e0028ac07d8b4f3dc550c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4ab8ed24/uploads/origins/92e80d0c-02fa-4ab5-bc8a-4ad9eb4859bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6e42bebfc76e0028ac07d8b4f3dc550c, https://si.imgix.net/4ab8ed24/uploads/orig